      "source_groundedness": 0.75,
      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "Highly on-point for the localization aspect of the query. Mostly grounded, but 23andMe tagged high_regulatory_compliance is a reasonable domain inference not explicit in text; generally defensible categorisation."
