  "analytical_usefulness": 0.85,
  "source_groundedness": 0.8,
  "rationale": "The added columns collectively decompose the business model along dimensions (delivery modality, service intensity, localization dependency, geographic scope, customer segment) that are highly relevant to a query about shifting toward service-oriented/localized models and assessing regional fit. Most values are sound readings or warranted inferences of the descriptions, with correct use of not_stated for silent rows. Groundedness is slightly reduced for the more subjective/inferential columns (service_intensity, localization_dependency) and especially company_maturity, which often relies on external knowledge rather than the source text."
